<title>USA: Proffitt's May same-store sales up 4.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Proffitt's May same-store sales up 4.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $159.0     $112.5     +41.0	 +4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	  May 31.</p>
<p>Full company name is Proffitt's Inc</p>
<p>Same-store comparisons exclude Parisian stores, acquired Oct 11 and accounted for as a purchase.</p>
<p>Sales for the 1996 period include restated results reflecting the February 1 acquisition of Herberger's stores, accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
</text>
